n the process of clearing  people or  giving presidential briefings  additionally  donald trump is now firing many of the  senior experienced  security officials in his own government  which means that we will be lowering our  defenses  at precisely the moment that our  adversaries  whether they be nation states or  terrorists  recognized that there's a vulnerability  so this is really playing recklessly  with the safety and security of the  american people  secretary albright i want to turn to you  now we heard health and human services  secretary azar say earlier this morning  that basically everything is public and  the the incoming biden administration  doesn't need any extra help what's your  reaction to that comment  well frankly i was appalled because i  think that  it is irresponsible and the biden people  are fully cognizant of the dangers  that have to do with covet and how it  has been mishandled  and the act that it has to be something  that is done for the health and the  lives of american people  and i find it stunning that we can be  constantly being told  that everything is normal and this is  the most selfish  irresponsible response to what is going  on domestically and  uh internationally and i so agree with  secretary chertoff on this  that it is something that should make us  very nervous  and very suspicious of everything that  is going on because we are being lied to  but you know secretary albright a recent  poll of republican shows that more than  half of them  think that this election was rigged  what's your reaction to that well i have  to say i'm stunned  because i believe in bipartisanship and  i believe in the truth  and i don't believe that it is  responsible of them  in many ways not to assess what is going  on  and i i find this a tragic time  in many ways having been through a  number of transitions myself  the importance of them they are a period  where the crown jewels are transferred  where people are talking to each other  about 